# barrel_roll.jsc - one left barrel roll (Z), 8 frames 0.1 s apart on a sheet, then a right roll.
# Checks: the roll animates through a full turn in 0.8 s with the lateral dash; no holes in
# the jet at any roll angle; no crash.
0     state title
+0    state free
+0.5  seek sea 45
+1.5  tap Z
+0    shot roll_0
+0.1  shot roll_1
+0.1  shot roll_2
+0.1  shot roll_3
+0.1  shot roll_4
+0.1  shot roll_5
+0.1  shot roll_6
+0.1  shot roll_7
+0    sheet barrel_roll 4
+0.5  tap X
+0.4  shot roll_right_mid
+0.6  assert crashes == 0
+0    end
